<Base title="Our Work | Colorteam" description="Brand identities, content engines and launches for global brands, festivals, conferences and growing organisations." image="/img/work-afrostrava-cover.webp" page="page-portfolio" navCurrent="/work/">
<div class="ct-page" id="page-portfolio"><section class="section hero podcast-hero" id="portfolio-top"><div aria-hidden="true" class="ct-hero-bg"><div class="ct-glow g"></div><div class="ct-glow p"></div><div class="ct-glow w"></div><div class="ct-grid"></div><div class="ct-noise"></div></div><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="hero-wrapper"><div class="inner-top-wrap"><a class="sub-title-wrap ct-pill-link" href="#portfolio-projects"><div class="new-text">Work</div><div class="inner-sub-title">Selected projects</div><img alt="" class="inner-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-right-lime.svg"/></a><h2 class="inner-title">Our Work</h2><p class="inner-details">Brand identities, content engines and launches for global brands, festivals, conferences and growing organisations.</p><div class="inner-button-wrap"><a class="primary-button w-inline-block is-green" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><div class="primary-btn-wrap"><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _01"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _02"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-bg"></div></div></a><a class="watch-button w-inline-block" href="#portfolio-projects"><div class="watch-btn-wrap"><img alt="" class="watch-icon" src="/img/icons/play.svg"/><div class="watch-btn-text">View Projects</div></div><div class="watch-btn-bg"></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section ct-projects" id="portfolio-projects"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="ct-proj-head"><h2 class="ct-proj-h">Selected Case Studies</h2><p>Three projects, three very different briefs, one approach: find the idea that matters to the audience, then build a system that scales it.</p></div><div class="ct-proj-list"><article class="ct-proj"><a class="ct-proj-media" href="/blog/bringing-africa-and-the-world-to-ostrava-the-afrostrava-case-study/"><img alt="AfrOstrava Festival: 171.1K viewers before the gates opened" loading="lazy" src="/img/work-afrostrava-cover.webp"/></a><div class="ct-proj-info"><div class="ct-proj-num">01</div><div class="ct-proj-main"><div class="ct-proj-client">AfrOstrava Festival <span>· 2025 to 2026</span></div><h3 class="ct-proj-title">171.1K viewers before the gates opened</h3><p class="ct-proj-desc">A brand, a website and a year-round social engine for a new multicultural festival in Ostrava.</p><div class="ct-proj-tags"><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Brand</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Design system</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Website</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Social campaign</span></div></div><div class="ct-proj-side"><a class="ct-proj-cta" href="/blog/bringing-africa-and-the-world-to-ostrava-the-afrostrava-case-study/">Read the case study <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class="ct-proj"><a class="ct-proj-media" href="/blog/designing-a-conference-identity-that-scales-across-50-assets-the-neclive-2025-case-study/"><img alt="NECLive 2025: One fingerprint, scaled to 50+ assets" loading="lazy" src="/img/work-neclive-cover.webp"/></a><div class="ct-proj-info"><div class="ct-proj-num">02</div><div class="ct-proj-main"><div class="ct-proj-client">NECLive 2025 <span>· 2025</span></div><h3 class="ct-proj-title">One fingerprint, scaled to 50+ assets</h3><p class="ct-proj-desc">A conference identity that carried from screens into the Landmark Centre, Lagos.</p><div class="ct-proj-tags"><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Visual identity</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Theme artwork</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Templates</span></div></div><div class="ct-proj-side"><a class="ct-proj-cta" href="/blog/designing-a-conference-identity-that-scales-across-50-assets-the-neclive-2025-case-study/">Read the case study <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article class="ct-proj"><a class="ct-proj-media" href="/blog/where-faith-meets-identity-the-kingdom-life-rebrand-case-study/"><img alt="Kingdom Life Church: One crown, a whole family of brands" loading="lazy" src="/img/work-kingdom-life-cover.webp"/></a><div class="ct-proj-info"><div class="ct-proj-num">03</div><div class="ct-proj-main"><div class="ct-proj-client">Kingdom Life Church <span>· 2025</span></div><h3 class="ct-proj-title">One crown, a whole family of brands</h3><p class="ct-proj-desc">An identity system for a growing church across four Polish cities and five ministries.</p><div class="ct-proj-tags"><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Logo</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Sub-brands</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Colour</span><span class="ct-chip is-ghost">Typography</span></div></div><div class="ct-proj-side"><a class="ct-proj-cta" href="/blog/where-faith-meets-identity-the-kingdom-life-rebrand-case-study/">Read the case study <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="18"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"></path></svg></a></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="section trusted" id="portfolio-trusted"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="trusted-wrapper"><div class="trusted-top-wrap"><div class="trusted-dots"></div><div class="trusted-title">Trusted by leading brands</div></div><div class="trusted-wrap"><div class="trusted-flex-wrap"><div class="trusted-single-wrap"><img alt="Netflix" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-netflix.png"/><img alt="Electrolux" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-electrolux.png"/><img alt="Phonak" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-phonak.png"/><img alt="BHM" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-bhm.png"/><img alt="NECLive" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-neclive.png"/><img alt="AfrOstrava" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-afrostrava.png"/><img alt="idafrica" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-idafrica.png"/><img alt="aspayr" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-aspayr.png"/></div><div class="trusted-single-wrap"><img alt="Netflix" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-netflix.png"/><img alt="Electrolux" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-electrolux.png"/><img alt="Phonak" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-phonak.png"/><img alt="BHM" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-bhm.png"/><img alt="NECLive" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-neclive.png"/><img alt="AfrOstrava" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-afrostrava.png"/><img alt="idafrica" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-idafrica.png"/><img alt="aspayr" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-aspayr.png"/></div><div class="trusted-single-wrap"><img alt="Netflix" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-netflix.png"/><img alt="Electrolux" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-electrolux.png"/><img alt="Phonak" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-phonak.png"/><img alt="BHM" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-bhm.png"/><img alt="NECLive" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-neclive.png"/><img alt="AfrOstrava" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-afrostrava.png"/><img alt="idafrica" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-idafrica.png"/><img alt="aspayr" class="trusted-single-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/logo-aspayr.png"/></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>
